# U43: site URL import with a recorded response. Paste a pobb.in link (matchURL: "URL is valid
# (pobb.in)"), RETURN (importCodeGo: importCodeFetching, "Retrieving paste..", buildSites.
# DownloadBuild of https://pobb.in/pob/u43Code048 = the code of allflame_exp_048), the next frame
# delivers it (importCodeHandle(data), importSelectedBuild: the confirm popup), RETURN (Init with
# importLink), and a snapshot. importCodeHandle(data) (ImportTab.lua:695) clears importCodeSite,
# so importSelectedBuild passes no import link: the snapshot's Import section has none (PoB's
# own behaviour; the Rust side must match it).
#! u43-expect-label URL is valid (pobb.in)
#! u43-expect-label Retrieving paste..
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
fixture net=net.json
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press i
key-up CTRL
frames 2
paste-clipboard "  https://pobb.in/u43Code048 "
move 492 528
click LEFTBUTTON
key-down CTRL
press v
key-up CTRL
frames 2
press RETURN
frames 1
frames 2
press RETURN
frames 3
snapshot site_url
frames 1
